id: QUAL-050
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: Empty catch block (swallowed exception)
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .ts .js .jsx .tsx .java .kt .cs .py .go
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ vendor/ node_modules/ .git/ build/ dist/
patterns:
  - regex: catch\s*\([^)]*\)\s*\{\s*\}
    message: "Empty catch block — exception is silently swallowed. At minimum, log the error."
  - regex: except:\s*$
    message: "Bare except with no handling (Python) — exception is silently swallowed"
fix: Log the error, rethrow it, or handle it explicitly. Never swallow exceptions silently.
